  "title": "Ex 4.10 · a | b gives a | (3b³ − b² + 5b)",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $a, b$ be integers. Show that if $a \\mid b$, then $a \\mid (3b^3 - b^2 + 5b)$.",
